   "text": "Lumpy Skin Disease (LSD)",
   "entry": "G1",
   "source": "farm_book"
  },
  {
   "text": "fever, firm raised skin nodules/lumps, enlarged lymph nodes, swelling of limbs or brisket, eye/nose discharge, reduced milk production, weakness, and sometimes skin lesions that become damaged or infected",
   "entry": "G1",
   "source": "farm_book"
  },
  {
   "text": "Foot-and-Mouth Disease (FMD)",
   "entry": "G2",
   "source": "farm_book"
  },
  {
   "text": "fever, excessive salivation/drooling, blisters or erosions in the mouth/tongue, sores around the feet/coronary band, lameness, reluctance to move, and sudden drop in milk",
   "entry": "G2",
   "source": "farm_book"
  },
  {
   "text": "Anthrax",
   "entry": "G3",
   "source": "farm_book"
  },
  {
   "text": "sudden death, fever before death, bleeding/discharge from body openings, rapidly bloating carcass, and lack of normal rigor mortis can occur, but signs are not always complete",
   "entry": "G3",
   "source": "farm_book"
  },
  {
   "text": "Blackleg",
   "entry": "G4",
   "source": "farm_book"
  },
  {
   "text": "sudden lameness, fever, painful swelling of large muscles, depression, and rapid death. Swellings can later feel crackly because of gas",
   "entry": "G4",
   "source": "farm_book"
  },
  {
   "text": "Mastitis",
   "entry": "G5",
   "source": "farm_book"
  },
  {
   "text": "swollen, hot, painful udder quarter; abnormal milk with flakes, clots, watery appearance or blood; reduced milk; fever or weakness in severe cases",
   "entry": "G5",
   "source": "farm_book"
  },
  {
