   "entry": "I2",
   "source": "farm_book"
  },
  {
   "text": "scabby lesions on comb, wattles, eyelids or unfeathered skin (\"dry\" form), or lesions in the mouth/upper respiratory tract (\"wet\" form)",
   "entry": "I2",
   "source": "farm_book"
  },
  {
   "text": "Heat stress in chickens",
   "entry": "I3",
   "source": "farm_book"
  },
  {
   "text": "panting, wings held away from body, crowding near water, reduced feed intake, reduced egg production, weakness, death in severe heat",
   "entry": "I3",
   "source": "farm_book"
  },
  {
   "text": "Maize Streak Virus (MSV)",
   "entry": "J1",
   "source": "farm_book"
  },
  {
   "text": "narrow pale/yellow streaks running along leaves; plants infected when young may become severely stunted and produce little grain",
   "entry": "J1",
   "source": "farm_book"
  },
  {
