   "entry": "J2",
   "source": "farm_book"
  },
  {
   "text": "long rectangular grey/tan lesions often restricted by leaf veins; lesions can merge and dry large areas of leaf",
   "entry": "J2",
   "source": "farm_book"
  },
  {
